      Al under the wyllowe tree.
 Comme, wythe acorne-coppe and thorne,Drayne mie hartys blodde awaie;Lyfe and all yttes goode I scorne,Daunce bie nete, or feaste by daie.
      Mie love ys dedde,
      Gon to hys death-bedde,
